u003cstrong\\u003e136-inch 4K. One box. One hour install.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEnterprise-grade 136-inch 4K Micro LED all-in-one display. COB technology, octa-core processor, 8GB RAM. Installs in under 1 hour with just 2 people. Factory-calibrated, Crestron and Yealink compatible.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; 4K display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe display features a fine pixel pitch of 0.93mm, delivering ultra-clear and sharp images ideal for close viewing distances such as boardrooms and lecture halls.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow long does it take to install the display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; 4K display can be installed in under one hour with just two people, thanks to its compact single-box design and plug-and-play setup.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat warranty options are available for this product?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBrightluxx offers standard manufacturer warranty coverage on the All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; 4K display, typically including parts and labor for 1-3 years. Extended warranty plans may be available upon request.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does this Micro LED display compare to traditional LCD or OLED screens?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis display uses COB Micro LED technology, providing superior brightness (600 nits), contrast ratio (15,000:1), and durability compared to LCD or OLED alternatives, especially for large-format 4K applications.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"All-in-One 136\\\\\\\" 4K LED