, 8GB RAM. Installs in under 1 hour with just 2 people. Factory-calibrated, Crestron and Yealink compatible.\", \"sku\": \"BL-AIO136\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio136\", \"category\": \"all-in-one\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-aio136.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 3000, \"highPrice\": 25000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio136\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.93mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"600 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"3840 x 2160 (4K UHD)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta58,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the All-in-One 136\\\" 4K display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features a fine pixel pitch of 0.93mm, delivering ultra-clear and sharp images ideal for close viewing distances such as boardrooms and lecture halls.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How long does it take to install the display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The All-in-One 136\\\" 4K display can be installed in under one hour with just two people, thanks to its compact single-box design and plug-and-play setup.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers standard manufacturer warranty coverage on the All-in-One 136\\\" 4K display, typically including parts and labor for 1-3 years. Extended warranty plans may be available upon request.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this Micro LED display compare to traditional LCD or OLED screens?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display uses COB Micro LED technology, providing superior brightness (600 nits), contrast ratio (15,000:1), and durability compared to LCD or OLED alternatives, especially for large-format 4K applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the display compatible with common AV control systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it seamlessly integrates with popular control platforms such as Crestron and Yealink, making it ideal for enterprise environments requiring easy AV management.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments is this display best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Due to its high resolution, brightness, and quick installation, it is perfect for boardrooms, lecture halls, and lobby areas where clear visuals and aesthetic appeal are priorities.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does this display support HDR content?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the All-in-One 136\\\" 4K supports both HDR10 and HDR10+, allowing for enhanced color depth and dynamic range for vivid, lifelike images.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pricing context for this premium LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing reflects its enterprise-grade features such as Micro LED tech, ultra-fine 0.93mm pixel pitch, and rapid installation. It represents a cost-effective solution given reduced installation time and the display's long-term reliability.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"All-in-One 136\\\\\\\" 4K\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio136\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T5cf,<h1>All-in-One 136&quot; 4K</h1><p>Experience stunning 4K clarity with All-in-One 136&quot; LED displays in Dubai. Brightluxx leads UAE's premium LED solutions market.</p><p><strong>136-inch 4K. One box. One hour install.</strong></p><p>Enterprise-grade 136-inch 4K Micro LED all-in-one display. COB technology, octa-core processor, 8GB RAM. Installs in under 1 hour with just 2 people. Factory-calibrated, Crestron and Yealink compatible.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the All-in-One 136&quot; 4K display?</h3><p>The display features a fine pixel pitch of 0.93mm, delivering ultra-clear and sharp images ideal for close viewing distances such as boardrooms and lecture halls.</p><h3>How long does it take to install the display?</h3><p>The All-in-One 136&quot; 4K display can be installed in under one hour with just two people, thanks to its compact single-box design and plug-and-play setup.</p><h3>What warranty options are available for this product?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers standard manufacturer warranty coverage on the All-in-One 136&quot; 4K display, typically including parts and labor for 1-3 years. Extended warranty plans may be available upon request.</p><h3>How does this Micro LED display compare to traditional LCD or OLED screens?</h3><p>This display uses COB Micro LED technology, providing superior brightness (600 nits), contrast ratio (15,000:1), and durability compared to LCD or OLED alternatives, especially for large-format 4K applications.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"All-in-One 136\\\" 4K LED Display - Premium Dubai Screens | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Experience stunning 4K clarity with All-in-One 136\\\" LED displays in Dubai. Brightluxx leads UAE's premium LED solutions market.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio136\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/bl-aio136\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":nul