"]}\"}}]\n14:T5cf,<h1>All-in-One 136&quot; 4K</h1><p>Experience stunning 4K clarity with All-in-One 136&quot; LED displays in Dubai. Brightluxx leads UAE's premium LED solutions market.</p><p><strong>136-inch 4K. One box. One hour install.</strong></p><p>Enterprise-grade 136-inch 4K Micro LED all-in-one display. COB technology, octa-core processor, 8GB RAM. Installs in under 1 hour with just 2 people. Factory-calibrated, Crestron and Yealink compatible.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the All-in-One 136&quot; 4K display?</h3><p>The display features a fine pixel pitch of 0.93mm, delivering ultra-clear and sharp images ideal for close viewing distances such as boardrooms and lecture halls.</p><h3>How long does it take to install the display?</h3><p>The All-in-One 136&quot; 4K display can be installed in under one hour with just two people, thanks to its compact single-box design and plug-and-play setup.</p><h3>What warranty options are available for this product?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers standard manufacturer warranty coverage on the All-in-One 136&quot; 4K display, typically including parts and labor for 1-3 years. Extended warranty plans may be available upon request.</p><h3>How does this Micro LED display compare to traditional LCD or OLED screens?</h3><p>This display uses COB Micro LED technology, providing superior brightness (600 nits), contrast ratio (15,000:1), and durability compared to LCD or OLED alternatives, especially for large-format 4K applications.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"c